abstract: Fifteen multilingual, offline-ready interactive AI labs spanning thirteen Foundations/course-track mechanisms and two Modern AI extensions. v1.7.1 is a compatibility and consistency patch that makes the standardized Transformer, agent, and Minimax shells use the same persisted theme preference as the original applets, migrates the temporary modern-shell theme key, and preserves the v1.7.0 fifteen-lab, all-Quick-Assign, four-language, algorithm, and curriculum boundaries.